From: Paul Gofman <pgofman@codeweavers.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Apr 2023 18:09:02 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] amd_ags_x64: Implement
 agsDriverExtensionsDX11_SetDepthBounds().

CW-Bug-Id: #22242
(cherry picked from commit 41c6841204636a1a56bbfa78b69f7e4e11ad6ae2)
---
 dlls/amd_ags_x64/Makefile.in         |   3 +-
 dlls/amd_ags_x64/amd_ags_x64_main.c  |  78 +++++++++++++++---
 dlls/amd_ags_x64/dxvk_interfaces.idl | 116 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 186 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 dlls/amd_ags_x64/dxvk_interfaces.idl

diff --git a/dlls/amd_ags_x64/Makefile.in b/dlls/amd_ags_x64/Makefile.in
